 34P   H TYP=FUL$AUT=LIJIE SUN AND JUN CHEN$CIT=ENSDF$CUT=30-Sep-2026$          
 34P   H TYP=FUL$AUT=NINEL NICA, BALRAJ SINGH$CIT=NDS 113, 1563 (2012)$         
 34P 2 H CUT=28-May-2012$                                                       
 34P  c  1987TrZZ: {+36}S(pol d,|a),(pol d,|a|g). E{-d}=6-16 MeV on             
 34P 2c  81.1%-enriched {+36}S target at the McMaster University tandem         
 34P 3c  accelerator. The |a particles were momentum analyzed by an Enge        
 34P 4c  split-pole spectrograph and detected in a focal-plane                  
 34P 5c  position-sensitive delay-line counter. The |g rays were measured using 
 34P 6c  a Ge detector. The |a|g(|q) measurements were performed using five     
 34P 7c  large NaI(Tl) detectors. Measured E|a, E|g, I|g, |a|g(|q), and tensor  
 34P 8c  analyzing powers (T{-20}). Deduced levels, J, |p, multipolarities, and 
 34P 9c  mixing ratios. Comparisons with shell-model calculations.              
 34P  c  1978Ba30: {+36}S(d,|a). E{-d}=3.05-3.26 MeV on 81.1%-enriched {+36}S   
 34P 2c  target at the Radium Institute. Measured |a spectra with a magnetic    
 34P 3c  spectrograph. Deduced levels.                                          
